WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:01.860
This is Media.

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:05.560
Our own shows, like the Vegans Explore Podcast,

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:09.440
bring you years of conversations with the people building this movement.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:11.700
Next to them are the podcasts,

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.320
documentaries, and books the community vouches for most.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:19.460
Press Play and listen right on the page while you keep looking around.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:23.540
Documentaries show where to watch them, and books link to their own pages.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.420
We want to hear from you.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.200
As a member, you shape what rises here.

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:30.380
Vouch for the shows, films,

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:31.540
and books you love.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.900
Save episodes to My Saves.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.840
Let us know if something needs to be fixed.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:38.960
And if you host a podcast,

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:41.140
apply to join our network.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:43.440
Membership is free.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:47.080
We ask for a short survey so we know real people are joining,

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.620
and that keeps this community worth your time.

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:51.260
Bring people with you:

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:55.700
invite your friends, your community, new Vegans and Pre-Vegans.

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:59.240
And you earn points for everybody who joins using your link.

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:04.240
That is the easiest way to grow your experience and open new doors in our

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:04.760
community.

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:07.600
Press Play on something good today.

